        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the Greed</strong> is a short, minimalistic <strong>incremental game</strong> about tiny skeleton villagers sacrificing creatures to satiate their greed for essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be finished in one sitting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takes about an hour to a few of hours to finish depending on your choices, strategy and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intended to be played actively</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/d8b7bfa39d6962073ffe98fbbd841cd0.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assign villagers to different buildings, generating offerings to be sacrificed to a mysterious space rift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ebdf1b02e793b9b59ea6c3ca5e4b4a09.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ac96df83c2824b205e464948730e96a7.apng?t=1758300236\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ac96df83c2824b205e464948730e96a7.poster.avif?t=1758300236\" class=\"bb_img\" width=624 height=52 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As your villagers lead the offerings to the space rift, it rewards them with essence. Providing enough offerings causes the space rift to grow, granting a <i>pure essence</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/6f6bcbd877b7dcd18f697bb1e7fa3a27.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <i>pure essence</i> to build different buildings, which will produce better offerings, accumulating more essence faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/3706ad091b9598f6156a4270e6b56bac.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use essence and <i>pure essence</i> to improve your offerings - like higher essence yield or unique effects. Some upgrades allow offerings to interact with each other, creating unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Pixel Font: Adventurer by Brian J Smith - CC-BY)</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the Greed</strong> is a short, minimalistic <strong>incremental game</strong> about tiny skeleton villagers sacrificing creatures to satiate their greed for essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be finished in one sitting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takes about an hour to a few of hours to finish depending on your choices, strategy and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intended to be played actively</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/d8b7bfa39d6962073ffe98fbbd841cd0.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assign villagers to different buildings, generating offerings to be sacrificed to a mysterious space rift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ebdf1b02e793b9b59ea6c3ca5e4b4a09.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ac96df83c2824b205e464948730e96a7.apng?t=1758300236\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ac96df83c2824b205e464948730e96a7.poster.avif?t=1758300236\" class=\"bb_img\" width=624 height=52 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As your villagers lead the offerings to the space rift, it rewards them with essence. Providing enough offerings causes the space rift to grow, granting a <i>pure essence</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/6f6bcbd877b7dcd18f697bb1e7fa3a27.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <i>pure essence</i> to build different buildings, which will produce better offerings, accumulating more essence faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/3706ad091b9598f6156a4270e6b56bac.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use essence and <i>pure essence</i> to improve your offerings - like higher essence yield or unique effects. Some upgrades allow offerings to interact with each other, creating unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Pixel Font: Adventurer by Brian J Smith - CC-BY)</i></p>",
